<title>USA: Labor Ready revenues rise in January.</title>
<headline>Labor Ready revenues rise in January.</headline>
<dateline>TACOMA, Wash. 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Labor Ready Inc Friday said revenue rose 67 percent in January to $12.5 million from $7.5 million.</p>
<p>Adjusted for the same number of business days as the year-ago period, January sales rose 91 percent.</p>
<p>Labor Ready said comparable dispatch office revenue for January 1997 increased 34 percent over January of last year.</p>
